### Stage 1: Foundation Infrastructure
**Files**: [main.py](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/apps/api/src/main.py), [ci.yml](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/.github/workflows/ci.yml)

