### Stage 2: Security & RBAC Architecture
**Files**: [rbac.py](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/apps/api/src/core/security/rbac.py), [jwt.py](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/apps/api/src/core/security/jwt.py), [auth.py](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/apps/api/src/api/v1/auth.py)

**7 Distinct Roles** (know all of them):

| Role | Who They Are | What They Can Do |
|------|-------------|-----------------|
| `PLATFORM_ADMIN` | System administrator | Everything — global scope |
| `STATE_AUTHORITY` | State disaster management | State-wide operations |
| `DDMA` | District Disaster Management Authority | District-scoped operations + authorization |
| `PWD` / `BRO` / `NHIDCL` | Public Works, Border Roads, Highways | Road/asset-scoped operations |
| `FIELD_OFFICER` | On-ground personnel | Limited read + field reporting |
| `CITIZEN_REPORTER` | General public | Submit reports only |
| `OBSERVER_AUDITOR` | Read-only oversight | Audit trail access |

**Key Security Features**:
- JWT token authentication with RS256/HS256
- BOLA (Broken Object Level Authorization) defense — you can't access another district's data
- Mass assignment protection — server derives all privileged fields
- Rate limiting per role
- Correlation IDs for request tracing

---

### Stage 3: Domain Data & Geospatial Foundation
**Files**: [domain.py (schemas)](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/apps/api/src/schemas/domain.py), [geojson.py](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/apps/api/src/schemas/geojson.py), [repository.py](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/apps/api/src/db/repository.py)

**7 Authoritative Domain Entities** (memorize these):

| Entity | What It Is | Geometry Type |
|--------|-----------|---------------|
| **District** | Administrative governance boundary | MultiPolygon |
| **SlopeUnit** | Hydrologically-bounded terrain management unit | Polygon |
| **Road** | Transportation artery (NH/SH/MDR/Border Road) | LineString |
| **RoadChainage** | Kilometer marker reference post along a road | Point |
| **Village** | Habitation settlement with population data | Point |
| **Asset** | Critical infrastructure (bridges, hospitals, water supplies) | Point/Polygon |
| **LandslideEvent** | Historical/observed landslide occurrence | Point/Polygon |

**Technical Highlights**:
- All coordinates in **EPSG:4326** (WGS84, [Longitude, Latitude])
- Strict GeoJSON validation (coordinate bounds, ring closure, payload < 2MB)
- MongoDB with `2dsphere` spatial indexes on every geometry field
- Compound indexes optimized for operational queries

