### Stage 4: Operational Geospatial Map
**Files**: [map/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Abhishek/SIH%20-%202026/apps/web/src/app/map/page.tsx)

- **Engine**: Leaflet (dynamically imported, SSR disabled)
- **Basemap**: OpenStreetMap with tactical dark-mode filtering (zero proprietary API keys!)
- **Default View**: Centered on Northeast India `[23.73, 92.72]`, Zoom 11
- **7 toggleable layers** with distinct symbology:
  - Districts (Indigo), Slope Units (Emerald), Roads (Blue), Chainages (Cyan), Villages (Amber), Assets (Violet), Landslide Events (Orange)
- **3 Spatial Query Modes**:
  1. Overview/Viewport mode — bounded reads
  2. Nearby Proximity mode — interactive radius slider (up to 50 km)
  3. Point Query mode — click to find intersecting geometries
- **WCAG 2.2 AA**: Accessible data roster with keyboard navigation

